#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD2263 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "PCLAS rows carry valid MED-RT terms of the dummy dictionary in their preferred case (Cyclooxygenase Inhibitors, Adrenergic beta-Antagonists) - the flag-less rule compares case-sensitively per the D-TA-3 default (Fix #266); the blank-TSVAL PCLAS row does not fire and the garbage TSVAL on the AGEMAX row is outside the PCLAS condition -> no violation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
---
S01 | TS | 1 | PCLAS  | Cyclooxygenase Inhibitors
S01 | TS | 2 | PCLAS  | Adrenergic beta-Antagonists
S01 | TS | 3 | PCLAS  |
S01 | TS | 4 | AGEMAX | NOT A PHARM CLASS
